('wikiloc', '118373008', 'https://www.wikiloc.com/hiking-trails/la-soca-100-cims-118373008', 'La Soca (100 Peaks)', '{"en":"Moderate loop from Montferrer","ca":"Circular moderada des de Montferrer","es":"Circular moderada desde Montferrer"}'::jsonb, 'La Soca (100 cims) Hiking trail in Montferrer, Occitanie (France). Download its GPS track and follow the itinerary on a map. Tipo: TrekkingHora Inicio: 9:16 5 nov 2022Hora Fin: 12:35 5 nov 2022Distancia recorrida: 10,6 km (03:18)Tiempo en movimiento: 02:50Velocidad media: 3,21 km/hVel. en Mov.: 3,74 km/hVelocidad Máxima: 8,22 km/hAltura Mínima: 1039 mAltura Máxima: 1645 mVelocidad Ascenso: 371,3 m/hVelocidad Descenso: 545,1 m/hGanancia Altitud: 629 mPérdida Altitud: 614 mTiempo Ascenso: 01:41Tiempo Descenso: 01:07', '{"en":"This easy 10.6 km loop to La Soca starts and ends in Montferrer, offering a straightforward trekking experience. The route involves a total elevation gain of 593 meters, with a maximum altitude of 1645 meters.\n\nThe trail is suitable for hikers looking for a relaxed day out, with a steady pace and no significant technical challenges. It provides an accessible way to reach the summit and enjoy the surrounding landscapes.","ca":"Aquesta ruta circular fàcil de 10.6 km a la Soca comença i acaba a Montferrer, oferint una experiència de trekking senzilla. La ruta implica un desnivell positiu total de 593 metres, amb una altitud màxima de 1645 metres.\n\nEl sender és adequat per a excursionistes que busquen una jornada relaxada, amb un ritme constant i sense grans desafiaments tècnics. Proporciona una manera accessible d''arribar al cim i gaudir dels paisatges circumdants.","es":"Esta ruta circular fácil de 10.6 km a La Soca comienza y termina en Montferrer, ofreciendo una experiencia de trekking sencilla. La ruta implica un desnivel positivo total de 593 metros, con una altitud máxima de 1645 metros.\n\nEl sendero es adecuado para excursionistas que buscan una jornada relajada, con un ritmo constante y sin grandes desafíos técnicos. Proporciona una manera accesible de llegar a la cima y disfrutar de los paisajes circundantes."}'::jsonb, 'Maquiavelo', 10622, 593, 593, 1645, 1039, 'easy', 'loop', NULL, 11880, 11920, '2022-11-04', '2022-10', '[{"lat":42.440777,"lng":2.558461,"ele":1039.4},{"lat":42.440777,"lng":2.558461,"ele":1039.4},{"lat":42.440777,"lng":2.558462,"ele":1039.2},{"lat":42.440776,"lng":2.558463,"ele":1039.2},{"lat":42.440776,"lng":2.558463,"ele":1039.2},{"lat":42.440776,"lng":2.558463,"ele":1039.2},{"lat":42.440776,"lng":2.558462,"ele":1039.1},{"lat":42.440776,"lng":2.558462,"ele":1039.1},{"lat":42.440776,"lng":2.558462,"ele":1039.1},{"lat":42.440776,"lng":2.558462,"ele":1039.1},{"lat":42.440776,"lng":2.558462,"ele":1039.1},{"lat":42.440776,"lng":2.558462,"ele":1039.1},{"lat":42.440776,"lng":2.558462,"ele":1039.1},{"lat":42.440776,"lng":2.558462,"ele":1039.1},{"lat":42.440776,"lng":2.558462,"ele":1039.1},{"lat":42.440776,"lng":2.558462,"ele":1039.1},{"lat":42.440776,"lng":2.558462,"ele":1039.1},{"lat":42.440776,"lng":2.558462,"ele":1039.1},{"lat":42.440776,"lng":2.558462,"ele":1039.1},{"lat":42.440776,"lng":2.558462,"ele":1039.1},{"lat":42.440776,"lng":2.558455,"ele":1039.2},{"lat":42.440775,"lng":2.558442,"ele":1039.4},{"lat":42.440773,"lng":2.558425,"ele":1039.7},{"lat":42.440771,"lng":2.558408,"ele":1039.9},{"lat":42.440769,"lng":2.558391,"ele":1039.9},{"lat":42.440766,"lng":2.558375,"ele":1039.8},{"lat":42.440763,"lng":2.558359,"ele":1039.7},{"lat":42.440757,"lng":2.558343,"ele":1039.6},{"lat":42.440751,"lng":2.558328,"ele":1039.5},{"lat":42.440744,"lng":2.558311,"ele":1039.6},{"lat":42.440737,"lng":2.558295,"ele":1039.5},{"lat":42.44073,"lng":2.55828,"ele":1039.5},{"lat":42.440723,"lng":2.558265,"ele":1039.3},{"lat":42.440715,"lng":2.558251,"ele":1039.2},{"lat":42.440707,"lng":2.558235,"ele":1039.2},{"lat":42.440702,"lng":2.558218,"ele":1039.3},{"lat":42.440698,"lng":2.558202,"ele":1039},{"lat":42.440691,"lng":2.558188,"ele":1039.2},{"lat":42.44068