-“De Vinya Nova a la Cova de l’Arcada per Camí del Pont, Sajolida, Canal Migdia, Camí del Cabrit, Clot del Tambor i Can Jorba” 
ca.wikiloc.com/wikiloc/view.do?pic=rutes-senderisme&amp;slug=de-vinya-nova-a-la-cova-de-larcada-per-cami-del-pont-sajolida-canal-migdia-cami-del-cabrit-clot-del&amp;id=163581726&amp;rd=ca', '{"en":"This difficult 6.2 km loop with 800m of elevation gain starts from the Monastery of Santa Cecília, accessible via the BP-1103 road. The route begins by crossing the road and joining the GR path, heading towards Montserrat Monastery.\n\nThe trail ascends the equipped Canal del Cavall to the base of Cavall Bernat, then passes the panoramic Ermita de Sant Antoni and skirts Cap del Mort to reach the Camí Nou de Sant Jeroni. It deviates to climb L''Albarda Castellana and Miranda de Sant Jeroni, offering expansive views. The return descends via the Ermita Nova de Sant Jeroni and the steep Canal de Sant Jeroni.","ca":"Aquesta ruta circular difícil de 6,2 km amb 800 m de desnivell positiu comença des del Monestir de Santa Cecília, accessible per la carretera BP-1103. La ruta s''inicia creuant la carretera i unint-se al GR, en direcció al Monestir de Montserrat.\n\nEl camí ascendeix per la canal equipada del Cavall fins al peu del Cavall Bernat, després passa per la panoràmica Ermita de Sant Antoni i voreja el Cap del Mort per arribar al Camí Nou de Sant Jeroni. Es desvia per pujar a l''Albarda Castellana i la Miranda de Sant Jeroni, oferint vistes extenses. La tornada descendeix per l''Ermita Nova de Sant Jeroni i la costeruda Canal de Sant Jeroni.","es":"Esta ruta circular difícil de 6,2 km con 800 m de desnivel positivo comienza desde el Monasterio de Santa Cecília, accesible por la carretera BP-1103. La ruta se inicia cruzando la carretera y uniéndose al GR, en dirección al Monasterio de Montserrat.\n\nEl camino asciende por la canal equipada del Cavall hasta el pie del Cavall Bernat, luego pasa por la panorámica Ermita de Sant Antoni y bordea el Cap del Mort para llegar al Camí Nou de Sant Jeroni. Se desvía para subir a L''Albarda Castellana y la Miranda de Sant Jeroni, ofreciendo vistas extensas. El regreso desciende por la Ermita Nova de Sant Jeroni y la empinada Canal de Sant Jeroni."}'::jsonb, 'Aventura''t', 6212, 800, 803, 1209, 678, 'difficult', 'loop', NULL, NULL, 885, '2016-01-14', '2015-12', '[{"lat":41.611208,"lng":1.817091,"ele":683.2},{"lat":41.611182,"lng":1.816955,"ele":681.2},{"lat":41.61115,"lng":1.816901,"ele":680.4},{"lat":41.611117,"lng":1.816872,"ele":680.1},{"lat":41.610923,"lng":1.816737,"ele":680.7},{"lat":41.610876,"lng":1.81674,"ele":681.8},{"lat":41.610876,"lng":1.816747,"ele":682},{"lat":41.610897,"lng":1.816878,"ele":685.9},{"lat":41.610927,"lng":1.8171,"ele":689.2},{"lat":41.610917,"lng":1.817155,"ele":690},{"lat":41.610897,"lng":1.817211,"ele":691},{"lat":41.61087,"lng":1.817266,"ele":691.1},{"lat":41.610798,"lng":1.817506,"ele":690.7},{"lat":41.610637,"lng":1.817616,"ele":691.6},{"lat":41.610517,"lng":1.817659,"ele":693.2},{"lat":41.610504,"lng":1.817664,"ele":693.3},{"lat":41.610466,"lng":1.817677,"ele":693.7},{"lat":41.610322,"lng":1.817649,"ele":697.4},{"lat":41.61025,"lng":1.817681,"ele":698.5},{"lat":41.610204,"lng":1.817711,"ele":699.5},{"lat":41.610035,"lng":1.817776,"ele":703.8},{"lat":41.609882,"lng":1.81783,"ele":707.2},{"lat":41.609852,"lng":1.817868,"ele":707},{"lat":41.609806,"lng":1.817905,"ele":707.5},{"lat":41.609673,"lng":1.817939,"ele":709.9},{"lat":41.60955,"lng":1.817898,"ele":712.5},{"lat":41.609493,"lng":1.817828,"ele":715.6},{"lat":41.60944,"lng":1.817759,"ele":718.6},{"lat":41.609393,"lng":1.817748,"ele":719.2},{"lat":41.609299,"lng":1.817779,"ele":718.5},{"lat":41.609205,"lng":1.817828,"ele":716.9},{"lat":41.60912,"lng":1.81786,"ele":716.2},{"lat":41.609,"lng":1.817922,"ele":715.1},{"lat":41.608966,"lng":1.817922,"ele":715.5},{"lat":41.6089,"lng":1.817896,"ele":717.2},{"lat":41.608835,"lng":1.818007,"ele":713.8},{"lat":41.608813,"lng":1.818047,"ele":712.5},{"lat":41.60877,"lng":1.818019,"ele":714.3},{"lat":41.608659,"lng":1.818023,"ele":715.9},{"lat":41.608615,"lng":1.818102,"ele":