*Durada de la ruta 3:33’minuts amb l’esmorzar+reportatge
*Recordeu,s’ha de pujar a la muntanya com un vell,per arribar-hi com un jove', '{"en":"This moderate 7.3 km loop starts from a small parking area next to the Monastery of Sant Llorenç de Sous, accessible via the GIP-5237 road. The route features a short, easy scramble with ropes and offers a good balance of historical sites and natural terrain.\n\nThe trail heads towards Font de Roca Pastora, then climbs through oak and holm oak forests along a path marked by Itinerannia. It passes the Corral de l''Abat, an ancient 30m long structure utilizing a cliff cave, which served as a corral, fortification, and lookout. After a short, assisted scramble, the route links with a track leading to Castell de Falgars (997m) and eventually to Mare de Déu del Mont.","ca":"Aquesta ruta circular moderada de 7,3 km comença des d''un petit aparcament al costat del Monestir de Sant Llorenç de Sous, accessible per la carretera GIP-5237. La ruta inclou una petita i fàcil grimpada amb cordes i ofereix un bon equilibri entre llocs històrics i terreny natural.\n\nEl sender es dirigeix cap a la Font de Roca Pastora, per després pujar per boscos de roures i alzines per un camí marcat per Itinerannia. Passa pel Corral de l''Abat, una antiga construcció de 30m de llargada que aprofita una balma del cingle, que va servir de corral, fortificació i guaita. Després d''una curta grimpada assistida, la ruta enllaça amb una pista que condueix al Castell de Falgars (997m) i finalment a la Mare de Déu del Mont.","es":"Esta ruta circular moderada de 7,3 km comienza desde un pequeño aparcamiento junto al Monasterio de Sant Llorenç de Sous, accesible por la carretera GIP-5237. La ruta incluye una pequeña y fácil trepada con cuerdas y ofrece un buen equilibrio entre lugares históricos y terreno natural.\n\nEl sendero se dirige hacia la Font de Roca Pastora, para luego subir por bosques de robles y encinas por un camino marcado por Itinerannia. Pasa por el Corral de l''Abat, una antigua construcción de 30m de longitud que aprovecha una cueva en el acantilado, que sirvió de corral, fortificación y atalaya. Después de una corta trepada asistida, la ruta enlaza con una pista que conduce al Castell de Falgars (997m) y finalmente a la Mare de Déu del Mont."}'::jsonb, 'Qfelip', 7323, 336, 336, 1117, 812, 'moderate', 'loop', 2820, 12780, 1254, '2022-12-30', '2022-11', '[{"lat":42.254958,"lng":2.715292,"ele":848.5},{"lat":42.254954,"lng":2.715231,"ele":848.6},{"lat":42.254948,"lng":2.715153,"ele":848.5},{"lat":42.254963,"lng":2.715212,"ele":848.5},{"lat":42.25496,"lng":2.715285,"ele":848.5},{"lat":42.254952,"lng":2.715356,"ele":848.5},{"lat":42.254937,"lng":2.715422,"ele":848.4},{"lat":42.254918,"lng":2.715478,"ele":848.2},{"lat":42.254895,"lng":2.715545,"ele":847.9},{"lat":42.254877,"lng":2.715609,"ele":847.6},{"lat":42.254836,"lng":2.715642,"ele":847.4},{"lat":42.25481,"lng":2.715691,"ele":847.3},{"lat":42.254773,"lng":2.715737,"ele":847.1},{"lat":42.254737,"lng":2.715783,"ele":846.8},{"lat":42.254695,"lng":2.715831,"ele":846.4},{"lat":42.254658,"lng":2.715881,"ele":845.9},{"lat":42.254632,"lng":2.715933,"ele":845.4},{"lat":42.254599,"lng":2.715975,"ele":845.2},{"lat":42.254558,"lng":2.716028,"ele":845},{"lat":42.254527,"lng":2.716085,"ele":844.7},{"lat":42.254488,"lng":2.716132,"ele":844.4},{"lat":42.254453,"lng":2.716187,"ele":844},{"lat":42.254423,"lng":2.716246,"ele":843.6},{"lat":42.254385,"lng":2.7163,"ele":843.2},{"lat":42.254356,"lng":2.716347,"ele":842.9},{"lat":42.254326,"lng":2.716407,"ele":842.5},{"lat":42.254291,"lng":2.716465,"ele":842.2},{"lat":42.254259,"lng":2.716523,"ele":842},{"lat":42.254223,"lng":2.71658,"ele":841.6},{"lat":42.254185,"lng":2.716631,"ele":841},{"lat":42.254153,"lng":2.716676,"ele":840.7},{"lat":42.254116,"lng":2.716727,"ele":840.2},{"lat":42.254076,"lng":2.716776,"ele":839.8},{"lat":42.254048,"lng":2.716827,"ele":839.4},{"lat":42.254014,"lng":2.71688,"ele":839},{"lat":42.253981,"lng":2.71693,"ele":838.6},{"lat":42.253941,"lng":2.716985,"ele"