https://youtu.be/8_BcuHpTEf0', '{"en":"This easy 10 km loop to Turó del Pou d''en Sala starts and ends at Coll Formic, located on the BV-5301 at km 26. Parking is available at the trailhead.\n\nThe trail is generally easy, combining wider tracks with smaller paths. It''s suitable for hikers looking for a straightforward ascent to this 1265-meter peak in the Montseny massif.","ca":"Aquesta ruta circular fàcil de 10 km al Turó del Pou d''en Sala comença i acaba a Coll Formic, situat a la BV-5301 al km 26. Hi ha aparcament disponible al punt d''inici.\n\nEl camí és generalment fàcil, combinant pistes amples amb senders més petits. És adequat per a excursionistes que busquen una pujada senzilla a aquest cim de 1265 metres al massís del Montseny.","es":"Esta ruta circular fácil de 10 km al Turó del Pou d''en Sala comienza y termina en Coll Formic, situado en la BV-5301 en el km 26. Hay aparcamiento disponible en el inicio del sendero.\n\nEl camino es generalmente fácil, combinando pistas anchas con senderos más pequeños. Es adecuado para excursionistas que buscan un ascenso sencillo a este pico de 1265 metros en el macizo del Montseny."}'::jsonb, 'nandomoneda', 9994, 402, 402, 1344, 1137, 'easy', 'loop', NULL, 10500, 869, '2023-01-12', '2022-12', '[{"lat":41.800779,"lng":2.347487,"ele":1140.6},{"lat":41.800778,"lng":2.347486,"ele":1140.6},{"lat":41.800772,"lng":2.347487,"ele":1138.6},{"lat":41.800777,"lng":2.347471,"ele":1138.6},{"lat":41.800774,"lng":2.347468,"ele":1138.6},{"lat":41.800822,"lng":2.347519,"ele":1138.5},{"lat":41.800904,"lng":2.347618,"ele":1138.5},{"lat":41.800933,"lng":2.347657,"ele":1139.3},{"lat":41.800935,"lng":2.347752,"ele":1139.3},{"lat":41.800944,"lng":2.347843,"ele":1139.3},{"lat":41.801003,"lng":2.347779,"ele":1139.2},{"lat":41.801051,"lng":2.347701,"ele":1139.2},{"lat":41.801111,"lng":2.347675,"ele":1139.1},{"lat":41.801141,"lng":2.347683,"ele":1141.8},{"lat":41.801147,"lng":2.347734,"ele":1144.3},{"lat":41.801188,"lng":2.347856,"ele":1146.6},