('wikiloc', '125474468', 'https://www.wikiloc.com/hiking-trails/rcnb-68-ruta-circular-al-castell-de-burriac-100cims-essencial-feec-des-de-argentona-125474468', 'RCnB-68 Ruta circular al Castell de Burriac (100cims essencial FEEC) des de Argentona', '{"en":"Circular from Argentona, shorter option","ca":"Circular des d''Argentona, opció curta","es":"Circular desde Argentona, opción corta"}'::jsonb, 'RCnB-68 Ruta circular al Castell de Burriac (100cims essencial FEEC) des de Argentona Hiking trail in Argentona, Catalunya (España). Download its GPS track and follow the itinerary on a map. Ruta fàcil per acomplir un nou 100cims essencial s la comarca del Maresme. Aquesta ruta pot reduir-se a la meitat si evitem el segon pic. Tot depend de l’objectiu del dia', '{"en":"This easy-to-moderate loop trail starts from Argentona and leads to Castell de Burriac. The route is suitable for hikers looking for a shorter outing, covering 7.4 km with 447 m of elevation gain. It offers a straightforward path to the castle, with an option to shorten the route by avoiding a second peak if desired.\n\nThe trail is generally accessible and does not present significant technical challenges, making it a good option for a quick visit to the castle and its surroundings in the Maresme region.","ca":"Aquesta ruta circular de dificultat fàcil a moderada comença a Argentona i porta al Castell de Burriac. L''itinerari és adequat per a excursionistes que busquen una sortida més curta, amb 7,4 km de distància i 447 m de desnivell positiu. Ofereix un camí directe al castell, amb l''opció d''escurçar la ruta evitant un segon cim si es desitja.\n\nEl sender és generalment accessible i no presenta reptes tècnics significatius, sent una bona opció per a una visita ràpida al castell i els seus voltants a la comarca del Maresme.","es":"Esta ruta circular de dificultad fácil a moderada comienza en Argentona y lleva al Castell de Burriac. El itinerario es adecuado para excursionistas que buscan una salida más corta, con 7,4 km de distancia y 447 m de desnivel positivo. Ofrece un camino directo al castillo, con la opción de acortar la ruta evitando un segundo pico si se desea.\n\nEl sendero es generalmente accesible y no presenta desafíos técnicos significativos, siendo una buena opción para una visita rápida al castillo y sus alrededores en la comarca del Maresme."}'::jsonb, 'Ramonbcntop', 7387, 447, 447, 410, 95, 'moderate', 'loop', 1620, 3540, 1229, '2023-02-09', '2023-01', '[{"lat":41.547718,"lng":2.397374,"ele":94.7},{"lat":41.547695,"lng":2.397305,"ele":94.7},{"lat":41.547688,"lng":2.397234,"ele":94.7},{"lat":41.547695,"lng":2.39716,"ele":94.7},{"lat":41.547692,"lng":2.397055,"ele":94.7},{"lat":41.54768,"lng":2.396993,"ele":94.7},{"lat":41.547663,"lng":2.396937,"ele":94.7},{"lat":41.547662,"lng":2.396857,"ele":94.7},{"lat":41.547649,"lng":2.396789,"ele":94.8},{"lat":41.547632,"lng":2.396721,"ele":94.8},{"lat":41.547613,"lng":2.396654,"ele":94.8},{"lat":41.547595,"lng":2.396587,"ele":95},{"lat":41.547597,"lng":2.396497,"ele":95.2},{"lat":41.547586,"lng":2.396438,"ele":95.3},{"lat":41.547561,"lng":2.396386,"ele":95.4},{"lat":41.547541,"lng":2.396326,"ele":95.6},{"lat":41.547526,"lng":2.39626,"ele":95.7},{"lat":41.54752,"lng":2.396182,"ele":96.2},{"lat":41.547517,"lng":2.396122,"ele":96.9},{"lat":41.547496,"lng":2.396046,"ele":97.2},{"lat":41.547479,"lng":2.395988,"ele":97.3},{"lat":41.547465,"lng":2.395928,"ele":97.5},{"lat":41.547467,"lng":2.395863,"ele":97.7},{"lat":41.547456,"lng":2.395799,"ele":98},{"lat":41.54743,"lng":2.395736,"ele":98.5},{"lat":41.547414,"lng":2.395665,"ele":99.2},{"lat":41.547403,"lng":2.395548,"ele":99.7},{"lat":41.547386,"lng":2.395489,"ele":99.9},{"lat":41.547367,"lng":2.395427,"ele":100.3},{"lat":41.547337,"lng":2.395369,"ele":100.5},{"lat":41.547305,"lng":2.395314,"ele":101.4},{"lat":41.547285,"lng":2.395257,"ele":101.7},{"lat":41.547255,"lng":2.3952,"ele":102.5},{"lat":41.547237,"lng":2.395141,"ele":103.3},{"lat":41.547216,"lng":2.395077